# T21 spot check: wrong way (HUD warning + wrong_way_buzzer cue, GDD §7.3/§13) — Quick Race on
# Backyard Bash; the car U-turns on the open lawn at the start and drives back down the start
# straight against the track. Gamepad for analog steering (single player owns every device).
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Sofa Circuit
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Backyard Bash
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait racing
hold gamepad throttle 0.8
hold gamepad steer 1
@100 hold gamepad steer 0
@100 hold gamepad throttle 1
@180 shot ww_01_3s
@240 shot ww_02_4s
@300 shot ww_03_5s
@360 shot ww_04_6s
@420 shot ww_05_7s
@480 release gamepad
1.0 exit
